              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ndelo no jangi yath pa Rwoth labedo maŋon to limo dwoŋ, aka ranyak ma lowo labedo noro gi dwoŋ pa Joisiraili ma joboth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋat'owey i Zayon to doŋ i Yerusalem ilalwoŋo ni ŋataleŋ, kisi ŋat'ondiki ri kwo i Yerusalem, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka Rwoth otieko lwoko woko cilo pa nyar Zayon to cido woko remo m'oduwo Yerusalem i diere mere gi cuny ma thumo banja kodi cuny maliel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
